                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>We prioritise environmental sustainability within and beyond AbbVie and engage our workforce to steward sustainability. Our Go Green group facilitates sharing of knowledge, expertise and experience to help us reduce our environmental impact both professionally and personally.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;“Looking after our environment is not optional – it is essential. We are now at a critical point with global warming, and there is a call to action for each of us to make a change. The&amp;nbsp;GoGreen&amp;nbsp;committee provides a platform to drive this change, whether your contribution is large or small. A green change begins with a single choice - planting hope instead of waste.”&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Shaun&amp;nbsp;Mcinness,&amp;nbsp;Member of Go Green Committee&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
