                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-01-27T02:10:03.662-05:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="singarx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>People do their best when they are their best. Our UK Vitality group coordinates well-being activities and events which support head office and remote based employee physical, mental, and emotional wellbeing.&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;“I’m&amp;nbsp;proud to be part of Vitality, our mission is to empower every AbbVie employee to thrive – physically, mentally, and emotionally – because we believe wellbeing is the foundation of personal fulfilment and professional excellence. By supporting each other in pursuing healthier, more balanced lives, we build a strong, more vibrant community together to excel both personally and professionally!”&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Louis Bibby,&amp;nbsp;Member of Vitality Committee&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </par_21>
