                                jcr:lastModified="{Date}2026-05-19T12:05:09.634-04:00"
                                jcr:lastModifiedBy="vickekx"
                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>The Women Leaders in Action (WLA) UK group’s mission is to drive a culture that empowers women to reach their full potential, attract and build future leaders and deliver business results and value by accessing the unique insights women can provide.&lt;br>&#xa;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xa;“As a committee, the Women Leaders in Action (WLA) ERG aims to deliver impactful,&amp;nbsp;thought-provoking&amp;nbsp;and inspirational content for our membership and the wider business. Our events cover a variety of topics to support and empower women to excel both at work and in their personal lives.&amp;nbsp;I’m&amp;nbsp;very proud&amp;nbsp;that we&amp;nbsp;are able to&amp;nbsp;encourage and enable women in our business to maximise their potential.&lt;br>&#xa;”&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xa;Lucy Southall-Evans, Member of WLA Committee.&lt;/p>&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </par_22>
