                                jcr:primaryType="nt:unstructured"
                                sling:resourceType="abbvie-com2/components/text/v2/text"
                                text="&lt;p>Serving our communities is core to who we are as a company. Our Volunteering at Heart group source individual employee or team volunteering opportunities and helps colleagues to organise their own volunteering activities.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;br>&#xd;&#xa;“Serving our communities is at the heart of who we are as a company. Volunteering not only gives us purpose and pride but also allows us to make a meaningful impact together. Collaborating with our AbbVie colleagues in these efforts helps us strengthen connections, foster teamwork, and grow as a united, resilient team dedicated to making a difference.”&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;&lt;p>Erika Gabilondo,&amp;nbsp;Member of Volunteering at Heart Committee&lt;/p>&#xd;&#xa;"
                                textIsRich="true"/>
                        </par_23>
